title: Ghost
---
<<if $has_vinyl_record == false>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Hey! The GUEST LIST? I don't have it… check with GOBLIN. Man, this music needs changing. // Add in case havent talked to before
    <<set $talked_to_ghost = true>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if $has_vinyl_record == false && $knows_vinyl_location == false>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Still looking for that GUEST LIST? I still need help with the music...
<<endif>>

<<if $has_vinyl_record == false && $knows_vinyl_location == true>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Hey did I hear Cat someone mention a VINYL RECORD?
<<endif>>

<<if $has_vinyl_record == true && $vinyl_playing == false>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Hey! The GUEST LIST? I don't have it… but the music needs changing.
    -> Is this the album you were looking for?
        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
        Ghost: …You found it! Been looking for this for ages! Thank you. This party is about to go INTERGALACTICAL!
        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
        Ghost: (Ghost plays a new track — upbeat, cosmic sounds.)
        <<change_music DJ>>
        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
        Ghost: Now… get people dancing.
        <<set $vinyl_playing = true>>
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if $vinyl_playing == true && $cat_goblin_dancing == false>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Didn't Goblin want to dance with Cat?
<<endif>>

<<if $cat_goblin_dancing == true && $know_brother_is_ghost == false>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Finally! Took those two long enough to end up dancing! Go Goblin and Black Cat! 
<<endif>>

<<if $know_brother_is_ghost == true>>
    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
    Ghost: Took you long enough! I was surprised you didn't recognize me, Neil-A, even with this mask on!
    -> Al-X! Why didn't you just reveal yourself! And why did you make me chase you all the way here?!
        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
        Ghost: You're too uptight all the time! And you can be rude and selfish! That's why I made you go through all this. Forced you to get out of your shell, make some friends, do things for other people! And look how well you did! I am… proud of you!
        -> …what is this liquidy secretion dripping from my eye orifice?
            <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
            Ghost: Those are tears my brother.
            -> *uncontrollable sobbing*
                <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
                Ghost: Okay… that's enough.
                -> *Continues Sobbing*
                    <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
                    Ghost: Alright, seriously, get it together.
                    -> Al-X, you have proven my errors to me. I will from now on be a changed Neil-A. Now we must return to our planet, our superiors await.
                        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
                        Ghost: I bet they're not expecting us until morning… what if we stay and…
                        <<play_dialogue Ghost>>
                        Ghost: (Together) PARTY HALLOWEEN STYLE!
                        <<set $found_brother = true>>
                        <<change_scene fin>>
<<endif>>

===
